293 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 227 0 R/E(These placements are intentionally designed to provide more than entry-level employment. Youth receive professional development workshops, mentorship, and individualized  support through city-funded employment agencies called YouthSource Centers,  which create a comprehensive model that combines wage earning with skill development and long-term career navigation. )/Pg 13 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

294 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 227 0 R/T(For participants, this means gaining a first professional reference, understanding workplace expectations, and accessing pathways into public and community service careers. For neighborhoods, it means expanding local service capacity and reinvesting talent directly into the communities most in need.)/E(For participants, this means gaining a first professional reference, understanding workplace expectations, and accessing pathways into public and community service careers. For neighborhoods, it means expanding local service capacity and reinvesting talent directly into the communities most in need.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

