endobj

328 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1050 0 R/E(280 participants identified as formerly or currently homeless)/Pg 14 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

329 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 1051 0 R/E(5 participants identified challenges related to mental health or substance use)/Pg 14 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

330 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 228 0 R/T(Youth contributed across multiple priority areas, often spanning more than one category, including public service \(1,040\), education \(902\), housing security \(131\), green jobs \(124\), food insecurity \(40\), and digital access \(27\). The gender distribution of participants included 63 percent identifying as female, 37 percent as male, and less than 1 percent selecting another gender identity option.)/E(Youth contributed across multiple priority areas, often spanning more than one category, including public service \(1,040\), education \(902\), housing security \(131\), green jobs \(124\), food insecurity \(40\), and digital access \(27\). The gender distribution of participants included 63 percent identifying as female, 37 percent as male, and less than 1 percent selecting another gender identity option.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

331 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 228 0 R/T(Taken together, these metrics demonstrate more than program volume. They reflect a workforce model that is reaching young people with the greatest barriers to employment, converting demand into structured opportunity, and translating public investment into measurable service hours within local communities. As YSC-LA continues to evolve, these data points provide a foundation for targeted growth, expanded regional access, and strengthened long-term workforce pathways.)/E(Taken together, these metrics demonstrate more than program volume. They reflect a workforce model that is reaching young people with the greatest barriers to employment, converting demand into structured opportunity, and translating public investment into measurable service hours within local communities. As YSC-LA continues to evolve, these data points provide a foundation for targeted growth, expanded regional access, and strengthened long-term workforce pathways.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

