457 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 231 0 R/T(Student to Student Success \(S2S\) provides high school students with paid work experience while they support elementary students in after-school settings. Participants are placed at LA\220s BEST \(Better Educated Students for Tomorrow\), a City of Los Angeles\205affiliated after-school program, where they assist with academic and enrichment activities for younger students.)/E(Student to Student Success \(S2S\) provides high school students with paid work experience while they support elementary students in after-school settings. Participants are placed at LA\220s BEST \(Better Educated Students for Tomorrow\), a City of Los Angeles\205affiliated after-school program, where they assist with academic and enrichment activities for younger students.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

458 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 231 0 R/T(Through this partnership, participants can transition the following semester into Part-Time Program Helper roles with LA\220s BEST, increasing their pay, gaining more flexible hours, and becoming LA\220s BEST employees\204strengthening both youth workforce pathways and support for elementary students across the City\220s after-school programs.)/E(Through this partnership, participants can transition the following semester into Part-Time Program Helper roles with LA\220s BEST, increasing their pay, gaining more flexible hours, and becoming LA\220s BEST employees\204strengthening both youth workforce pathways and support for elementary students across the City\220s after-school programs.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

