<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 234 0 R/E(The Summer Night Lights Expansion program hires young adults ages 16-24 to coordinate activities at 11 City parks and recreation centers to provide youth and families with fun gathering spaces during the summer months.  Participants work 16-40 hours a week, for up to 480 hours total, and can earn a wage of up to $22.00 an hour.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[20]>>
