521 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 234 0 R/E(The Student to Student Success program provides job skills training and paid employment to high-need students whol serve as tutors to younger siblings who have struggled academically as a result of the COVID-19 pandemic. Employed students  tutor at least one of their siblings or a school-aged relative living in the same household after school and/or on weekends. The purpose of the program is two-fold: to reverse  disproportionate learning loss experienced by our most vulnerable younger students; and to provide paid work experience and career exploration to older students to prepare them for essential employment in the education and childcare field. Program serves youth 14-24 years of age)/Pg 20 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

