<</Title(This work is made possible through strong cross-department collaboration and the dedication of community partners who guide, supervise, and invest in young people every day. I extend my sincere gratitude to the teams who deliver these programs and to the Angelenos whose commitment, resilience, and talent continue to define the success of YSC-LA.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1317 0 R/Prev 1419 0 R/Next 1506 0 R>>
