1491 0 obj
<</Title(The General Services Department \(GSD\) plays a critical behind-the-scenes role supporting all departments in the City of L.A., maintaining over 11,000 pieces of equipment for agencies such as the L.A. Police Department and the L.A. Fire Department. They host a paid 10-week Equipment Mechanic Internship Program that gives young adults with automotive backgrounds hands-on experience working in fleet repair shops. Interns gain real-world mechanical skills, professional training, and a certificate of completion that helps them pursue future city jobs. Through testimonials from long-time employees and former interns, the program is a pathway to stable employment, strong benefits, and long-term career growth within city government, placing an emphasis that even entry-level positions can lead to leadership roles with dedication and hard work.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1422 0 R/Next 1492 0 R>>
endobj

